1	/**
2	 * SandboxBridgeExecutor — calls the existing E2B / SSH sandbox bridge HTTP API.
3	 *
4	 * The sandbox bridge is a lightweight HTTP server that accepts command
5	 * execution requests and forwards them to an E2B sandbox or an SSH-accessible
6	 * machine (see `packages/adapter-utils/src/sandbox-callback-bridge.ts` for
7	 * the bridge protocol). This executor is the default for Cloudflare
8	 * deployments because Workers cannot spawn child processes.
9	 *
10	 * Configure via env vars (set via `wrangler secret put`):
11	 *   SANDBOX_BRIDGE_URL     — base URL of the running bridge server
12	 *   SANDBOX_BRIDGE_API_KEY — optional bearer token
13	 */
14	
